summary:
  The settings page's station list is asked for without an order.

history:
  Unordered, the directory answers by raw name: the list opened on names
  that begin with a tab or a space and the stations people know sat hundreds
  of rows down. Both of the page's requests are built in one place now, by
  votes; this takes the order out of that place.

target:
  package/contents/ui/SearchLogic.js

find:
          + "?hidebroken=true&order=votes&reverse=true&limit=" + n + "&offset=" + o;

replace:
          + "?hidebroken=true&limit=" + n + "&offset=" + o;

expect:
  Killed by tst_searchlogic::test_the_settings_list_is_asked_by_votes_a_page_at_a_time.
  Line-neutral.
